{"id":924070,"shortDescription":"Lánzate a la aventura en este juego de mazmorras de fantasía oscura. Encarna a un Yotun, un guerrero, y sumérgete en las tierras de Durnar para desenmascarar los misterios de tu tribu. Sírvete de las armas simbióticas para derrotar a tus enemigos y muta para hacerte mucho más fuerte.","developers":["Dreamplant"],"publishers":["All in! Games","Untold Tales"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"9 SEP 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795441320","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_5bc834ee683a585ea2845ac0b94991d0f9904a0f.600x338.jpg?t=1795441320","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_5bc834ee683a585ea2845ac0b94991d0f9904a0f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795441320"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_29f5a6f9e5aabb5b6a6d591d32e1d660ae79c1ee.600x338.jpg?t=1795441320","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_29f5a6f9e5aabb5b6a6d591d32e1d660ae79c1ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795441320"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_fa4e4396b4717be01d3e27d8f5755fa6269b81f4.600x338.jpg?t=1795441320","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_fa4e4396b4717be01d3e27d8f5755fa6269b81f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795441320"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_2f342f89d27dd16dc902466fcde18042bc9174b1.600x338.jpg?t=1795441320","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_2f342f89d27dd16dc902466fcde18042bc9174b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795441320"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/924070/ss_df8d9d2bb19c4daec55e748b83c8e